    "name": "Task Management API",
    "description": "This API was tested using Postman to validate all authentication and task management endpoints.\n\nA structured Postman collection was created containing all available routes, grouped by functionality (Auth and Tasks). The collection includes:\n\n- User registration and login requests\n    \n- Authenticated task CRUD operations\n    \n- Pagination testing (`limit` and `offset`)\n    \n- Bearer token authorization for protected routes\n    \n\nJWT authentication is configured at the collection level using a Bearer Token, allowing all protected endpoints to be tested consistently.\n\nThe exported Postman collection enables anyone to import and test the API endpoints without additional configuration.",
